OL,3,GNEWSAPolice boss on #188k set to retire
OL,4,Aand return
OL,5,
OL,6,FA chief constable on a #188,656-a-year
OL,7,Fsalary is set to retire for a month
OL,8,Fbefore being reappointed back to the
OL,9,Fjob in order to protect his pension.
OL,11,FSimon Megicks, appointed as the
OL,12,FCambridgeshire Police chief last year,
OL,13,Fis due to resign on 29 September and
OL,14,Fthen be reappointed on 28 October,
OL,15,Fsubject to a police and crime panel's
OL,16,Fapproval.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,374,370,200,160,0,100
