OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAPolice boss on #188k set to retire
OL,4,Aand return
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe move is legitimate under the
OL,7,Fnational Retire and Rejoin Scheme and
OL,8,Fwill prevent his pension pot reducing.
OL,9,FIt matures after 30 years' service but
OL,10,Freduces for each consecutive year of
OL,11,Fadditional service. By enforcing a
OL,12,Fbreak, it will be frozen at its maximum
OL,13,Famount.
OL,15,FA report to the panel states the scheme
OL,16,F"does not create any additional cost to
OL,17,Fthe taxpayer".
